      "versionNonce": 1803591815,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1779446174776,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "SCALE 1 \u2014 Proof of Concept (Mac M4 MPS)\n\n\u2022 Encoder FROZEN\n\u2022 500K corpus subsample (random, dev-positives preserved)\n\u2022 Dev queries split 80/20 (5,584 train / 1,396 eval)\n\u2022 5,951 training pairs (in-batch negs only)\n\u2022 20 epochs \u00d7 46 steps  =  920 optim steps\n\u2022 Wall-clock: ~10 sec training, ~20 sec eval\n\u2022 419K trainable params (heads only)",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "baseline": 11,
      "containerId": "1dpg8sbi4q2y",
      "originalText": "SCALE 1 \u2014 Proof of Concept (Mac M4 MPS)\n\n\u2022 Encoder FROZEN\n\u2022 500K corpus subsample (random, dev-positives preserved)\n\u2022 Dev queries split 80/20 (5,584 train / 1,396 eval)\n\u2022 5,951 training pairs (in-batch negs only)\n\u2022 20 epochs \u00d7 46 steps  =  920 optim steps\n\u2022 Wall-clock: ~10 sec training, ~20 sec eval\n\u2022 419K trainable params (heads only)",
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
