      "seed": 816862043,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 1024306180,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1779446174776,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "SCALE 2 \u2014 End-to-End on A100 80GB (Akash)\n\n\u2022 Encoder UNFROZEN (differential LR: enc=5e-5, head=2e-3)\n\u2022 Full 8.84M-passage corpus + 502K train queries\n\u2022 397.8M BM25 hard-neg triples \u2192 418,010 train tuples\n\u2022 5 epochs \u00d7 816 steps  =  4,080 optim steps\n\u2022 Mixed-precision fp16 + gradient checkpointing\n\u2022 Wall-clock: ~2 hr per training, ~50 min eval\n\u2022 23.1M trainable params (full encoder + heads)",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "baseline": 11,
      "containerId": "w1swjckjltei",
      "originalText": "SCALE 2 \u2014 End-to-End on A100 80GB (Akash)\n\n\u2022 Encoder UNFROZEN (differential LR: enc=5e-5, head=2e-3)\n\u2022 Full 8.84M-passage corpus + 502K train queries\n\u2022 397.8M BM25 hard-neg triples \u2192 418,010 train tuples\n\u2022 5 epochs \u00d7 816 steps  =  4,080 optim steps\n\u2022 Mixed-precision fp16 + gradient checkpointing\n\u2022 Wall-clock: ~2 hr per training, ~50 min eval\n\u2022 23.1M trainable params (full encoder + heads)",
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
