      "seed": 361062255,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 164023463,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1779446174776,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Three independent scoring variants on the same trained DRT checkpoint:\n\n  drt_learned_alphas    \u2192  MRR@10 = 0.3075\n  drt_uniform_alphas    \u2192  MRR@10 = 0.3076\n  drt_concat_cosine     \u2192  MRR@10 = 0.3076\n\nWithin 0.0001 of each other.\n\nThe decomposition + attention head adds zero discriminative power\nbeyond what plain cosine over the same encoder's output produces.",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "baseline": 11,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Three independent scoring variants on the same trained DRT checkpoint:\n\n  drt_learned_alphas    \u2192  MRR@10 = 0.3075\n  drt_uniform_alphas    \u2192  MRR@10 = 0.3076\n  drt_concat_cosine     \u2192  MRR@10 = 0.3076\n\nWithin 0.0001 of each other.\n\nThe decomposition + attention head adds zero discriminative power\nbeyond what plain cosine over the same encoder's output produces.",
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
