      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1779446174776,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "2. The attention head learned NOTHING",
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "baseline": 15,
      "containerId": "ses6m033ifhv",
      "originalText": "2. The attention head learned NOTHING",
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "fcpkjcslqc3c",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1320,
      "y": 1720,
      "width": 1040,
      "height": 170,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1855962816,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 2098882933,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1779446174776,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Learned \u03b1  vs  uniform \u03b1 (1/k):\n   MRR@10 0.3075   vs   0.3076   (\u0394 < 0.0001)\n\nThe trained softmax over 6 slots is, for retrieval purposes,\nequivalent to a uniform distribution. Query-adaptive weighting\nis the second pillar of DRT \u2014 and it's a no-op.",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "baseline": 11,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Learned \u03b1  vs  uniform \u03b1 (1/k):\n   MRR@10 0.3075   vs   0.3076   (\u0394 < 0.0001)\n\nThe trained softmax over 6 slots is, for retrieval purposes,\nequivalent to a uniform distribution. Query-adaptive weighting\nis the second pillar of DRT \u2014 and it's a no-op.",
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "4wsqt26q3xlr",
      "type": "rectangle",
      "x": 160,
      "y": 1950,
      "width": 1080,
      "height": 50,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#e03131",
