      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1779446174776,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "3. Slots are statistically uncorrelated but semantically interchangeable",
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "baseline": 15,
      "containerId": "4wsqt26q3xlr",
      "originalText": "3. Slots are statistically uncorrelated but semantically interchangeable",
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "komv2xcdyk0x",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 180,
      "y": 2010,
      "width": 1040,
      "height": 170,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1946356127,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 1294290138,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1779446174776,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Single-slot MRR@10 (using only slot i, \u03b1i=1, others=0):\n   slot 0..5  \u2192  0.2611 / 0.2577 / 0.2611 / 0.2611 / 0.2561 / 0.2608\n   range:  0.0050\n\nPer-slot probe (logistic reg, factoid classification):\n   slots 0..5  \u2192  0.759 / 0.761 / 0.769 / 0.774 / 0.774 / 0.761\n   range:  0.015  (concat 6\u00d764 reaches 0.813)\n\nDecorrelation made them statistically independent, NOT semantically distinct.",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "baseline": 11,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Single-slot MRR@10 (using only slot i, \u03b1i=1, others=0):\n   slot 0..5  \u2192  0.2611 / 0.2577 / 0.2611 / 0.2611 / 0.2561 / 0.2608\n   range:  0.0050\n\nPer-slot probe (logistic reg, factoid classification):\n   slots 0..5  \u2192  0.759 / 0.761 / 0.769 / 0.774 / 0.774 / 0.761\n   range:  0.015  (concat 6\u00d764 reaches 0.813)\n\nDecorrelation made them statistically independent, NOT semantically distinct.",
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
