      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1779446174776,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "4. The encoder drifted (didn't break)",
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "baseline": 15,
      "containerId": "5mufm8zov7ln",
      "originalText": "4. The encoder drifted (didn't break)",
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "riec4d145bm1",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1320,
      "y": 2010,
      "width": 1040,
      "height": 170,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 281425679,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 1282576973,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1779446174776,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Linear CKA on 6,980 dev queries:\n   baseline encoder  vs  DRT raw encoder      :  0.9452\n   baseline encoder  vs  DRT concat sub-vecs  :  0.8297\n\nThe encoder is 94.5% similar to the cosine-trained one \u2014 a small\nshift, but enough to cost 2% MRR@10. DRT loses HARDER on factoid\nqueries (79 of top-100 losses are factoid vs 59 of top-100 wins).",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "baseline": 11,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Linear CKA on 6,980 dev queries:\n   baseline encoder  vs  DRT raw encoder      :  0.9452\n   baseline encoder  vs  DRT concat sub-vecs  :  0.8297\n\nThe encoder is 94.5% similar to the cosine-trained one \u2014 a small\nshift, but enough to cost 2% MRR@10. DRT loses HARDER on factoid\nqueries (79 of top-100 losses are factoid vs 59 of top-100 wins).",
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "nf313fpoyipk",
      "type": "text",
